<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Arden Realty started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Arden Realty started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said it started coverage of Arden Realty Group Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares unchanged at 27-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
